    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41388,41944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>エトス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ethos</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41504,41728,42028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41288</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_084_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>結局、ヴァルハラの魔術の暴走って
魔科学兵器のせいだったんだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So it turns out the out-of-control magic in Valhalla
was all 'cause of a magitech weapon, huh.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41392</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_084_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>１５０年も前のものが
今の時代にも残ってたなんて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's hard to believe a weapon from
150 years ago was still there today...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41508</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_084_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんな危険なものの上で、
みんな何も知らずに生活してたんだね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Everyone was living their lives, unaware of
the danger sitting just beneath their feet...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41620</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_084_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もし&lt;Mel&gt;が発見しなかったら、
ずっとあのままだったんだぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you hadn't found it, &lt;Mel&gt;, it
may've stayed there forever.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41732</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_084_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>発見っていうか……
わたしが原因で事故になったっていうか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I didn't really find it, though... It's more
like I'm the one who made it a problem...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41856</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_084_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だって、あれからヴァルハラで
調査したら地面からたくさん出てきたんだぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But they searched Valhalla after and
found a ton of those things, yeah?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41948</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_084_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうだね、それって
&lt;Mel&gt;のおかげだよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. And they were able to
find them thanks to you, &lt;Mel&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42032</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_084_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そっか……
……そうなのかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... ...Is
that really true?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42124</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_003_084_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ほんと、&lt;Mel&gt;って
前向きになんねーのな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C'mon, &lt;Mel&gt;, you don't always
have to be so negative.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Notice</Section>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
